<title>SWITZERLAND: Valora boosts 1996 group net 75 percent.</title>
<headline>Valora boosts 1996 group net 75 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net			   72.1	   vs    41.2</p>
<p> Div (Sfr)			6		   vs 5</p>
<p> Turnover			 2,895.6	   vs 2,869.4</p>
<p> Cash flow			  183.0	   vs   152.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Valora Holding AG, a retail group. It changed its name last year from Merkur Holding AG. Figures do not include German unit Stilke GmbH, which will be consolidated as of January 1997.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
